#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge1/scripts.inc:226
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge1_Text_NoTimeForMyAdvice"
msgid ""
"What?\n"
"You have no time for my advice?\p"
"You should always be eager to learn\n"
"from the experiences of your elders!$"
msgstr ""
"什么？\n"
"你没空听我的建议？\p"
"你应该时刻虚心地\n"
"学习长辈的经验才对！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge1/scripts.inc:233
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge1_Text_HaveBusinessNeedsTending"
msgid ""
"Yes, what is it now?\p"
"I have business that needs tending!\n"
"Save it for next time!$"
msgstr ""
"又怎么了？\p"
"我还有事要忙呢！\n"
"下次再说吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge1/scripts.inc:238
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge1_Text_LetsLookAtYourPokemon"
msgid ""
"Ah, youngster! Do your POKéMON's\n"
"abilities intrigue you?\p"
"Here, here!\n"
"Let's have a look at your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，年轻人！你对你的宝可梦的\n"
"能力感兴趣吗？\p"
"来，来！\n"
"让我看看你的宝可梦吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge1/scripts.inc:244
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge1_Text_EvenICantTell"
msgid ""
"An expert I am, but even I can't tell\n"
"anything about an unhatched POKéMON!\p"
"Show me a POKéMON!\n"
"A POKéMON is what I need to see!$"
msgstr ""
"我虽然是专家，但还没孵化的\n"
"宝可梦我也看不出什么来！\p"
"给我看宝可梦！\n"
"我要看的是宝可梦！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge1/scripts.inc:250
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge1_Text_SaidMyMonIsOutstanding"
msgid ""
"He said my POKéMON is outstanding!\n"
"I'm glad I raised it carefully!$"
msgstr ""
"他说我的宝可梦非常杰出！\n"
"幸好我用心培育了它！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge1/scripts.inc:254
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge1_Text_DidntDoAnythingSpecialRaisingIt"
msgid ""
"He said my POKéMON is outstanding!\n"
"But I didn't do anything special\l"
"raising it…$"
msgstr ""
"他说我的宝可梦非常杰出！\n"
"可是我培育它的时候\l"
"也没做什么特别的事啊……$"
